    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mtext>value&#160;between&#160;</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#160;to</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p>RHD at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>RHD&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>LHD&#160;at&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>p</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>p</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not differentiable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, therefore</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>",
